function ignore value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)

[an|] integer means: @intrinsic("type", "int")

fixed quantity means: @intrinsic("fix", quantity)

to get the number selected from [a fixed value of {fixed integer:number}|a plain value of number]:
	@intrinsic("return", number)

ignore @intrinsic("variadic call", "libc", "printf", @intrinsic("type", "int"), 1, "%d\n", the number selected from a fixed value of 81)
